                    "content": "```kotlin\nimport java.util.Scanner\n\nfun main() {\n    val br = System.`in`.bufferedReader()\n    val n = br.readLine().trim().toInt()\n    val tokens = br.readLine().trim().split(\" \").map { it.toInt() }\n    val arr = IntArray(n)\n    var ones = 0\n    for (i in 0 until n) {\n        arr[i] = tokens[i]\n        if (arr[i] == 1) ones++\n    }\n    \n    // value for flipping: 0 -> +1 gain, 1 -> -1 gain\n    val gain = IntArray(n)\n    for (i in 0 until n) {\n        gain[i] = if (arr[i] == 0) 1 else -1\n    }\n    \n    // Kadane's algorithm to find max subarray sum (non-empty)\n    var maxSoFar = gain[0]\n    var maxEndingHere = gain[0]\n    for (i in 1 until n) {\n        maxEndingHere = maxOf(gain[i], maxEndingHere + gain[i])\n        maxSoFar = maxOf(maxSoFar, maxEndingHere)\n    }\n    \n    val result = ones + maxSoFar\n    println(result)\n}\n```",
